# "Whenever equipped creature dies": dies means battlefield to graveyard (CR 700.4), and only the equipped one. Bot1 equips the Elves for {B}
# on turn one beside an unequipped Ornithopter. Turn two: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Ornithopter (not equipped: no card) and Swords to
# Plowshares exiles the Elves (equipped, but not dying: no card). Bot1's hand stays empty and the Crown ends up unattached.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Transmogrant's Crown
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Swords to Plowshares
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
